  click APP_LAUNCH href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/NudgeApp.swift#L21" "didFinishLaunchingWithOptions. Sets UNUserNotificationCenter.current().delegate = NudgeNotificationService.shared synchronously so a response that launched the app is not lost; registers categories; calls NudgeNotificationService.configure(), which is empty; registers the dailyRecalc task and submits the next 6 AM request." _blank
  click N_CATS href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/NudgeNotificationCategories.swift#L112" "registerAll → setNotificationCategories with 13 categories: eventBlock, idle, getAhead (legacy, nothing schedules it), prep, dueSoon, morningPrompt, floater, comeBack, placementLead, placementMissed, goalLapse, limit, mirror. Actions: startSession (foreground), snooze30, idleYesGood, idleNotYet (foreground), markUnhelpful (not foreground). Every category has customDismissAction." _blank
